# WP-02 Backend runtime

Complete Gate 2 without handwritten controllers.

Already executable: Axum routes, body/path/query/header/cookie binding, bearer auth,
request and response middleware, capacity-backed rate-limit (429), capacity-backed
CORS (`Access-Control-*` + OPTIONS preflight), typed events, durable SQLite,
Cache get/put/invalidate (memory + durable SQLite),
Logger/Metrics/Tracer observability (memory).

Next: production auth adapters (secrets, JWT/OAuth) behind capacities.

Use the prompt template in `docs/agent-work-packages.md`. Stop at the AXL boundary when a primitive is missing.
